  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Platinum Bar.png|200px|left|Platinum bar]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |level = 25\n |price = 1 to 205\n |time = 16 h\n |xp = 24\n |upgrades = {{Infoicon|ptrain|big|link=Personal Train}}\n |source = {{Infoicon|smelter|bigger|link=Smelter}}\n |base = 57\n |dia = 12\n |time3 = 13 h 36 min\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n}}\n'''Platinum bars''' are [[products]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 25.\n\nPlatinum bars are used to make [[Jeweler|jewelry]], and to upgrade the [[Personal Train|personal train]] in the player's [[town]].\n\nLike all [[products]], they are stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Making platinum bars'''===\n[[File:Smelter.png|150px|left|Smelter]]\nPlatinum bars are made in the [[Smelter]].\n\nTo make a platinum bar, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Platinum Ore.png|75px|Platinum ore|link=Platinum Ore]]\n|-\n|'''x3'''\n|}\nIt takes 16 hours to make one bar, and 13 hours 36 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] smelter. Each bar gives players 24 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Selling platinum bars'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside Shop]]\n* Platinum bars can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 2,052 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 bars.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a bar costs 96 {{Infoicon|Coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Using platinum bars'''===\nPlatinum bars are used to make the following [[products]]:\n\n{{Item Usage|Platinum Bar\n|Necklace|1|39\n|Diamond Ring|2|40\n|Flower Pendant|1|98\n}}\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n* As is the case for all Smelter products, completing a [[truck]] order requesting one or more bars rewards players with a random [[voucher]].\n* [[Boat]] orders never ask for plantinum bars\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Platinbarren\n|es = Lingote de platino\n|fr = Lingot de Platine\n|it = Lingotto di platino\n|nl = Platinastaaf\n|no = Platinabarre\n|ru = Слиток платины\n|zh = Platinum Bar\n}}\n[[pt-br:Barra de platina]]\n\n[[Category:Smelter Products]]\n[[Category:Platinum Ore Products]]",
